.com/2026/11/24/climate/iowa-army-ammunition-plant-explostion.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:57:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等2家] 随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</link><description>美国股市周二下跌，回吐了前一交易日因黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官而引发的部分大幅上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html'&gt;随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq declines as Nvidia slides, giving back part of Monday’s rally: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html'&gt;Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Markets Slip as Nvidia and A.I. Stocks Erase Some of Monday’s Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:07:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</link><description>追逐趋势的量化基金正在削减其长期持有的美国国债空头头寸，随着股票抛售重振对政府债务的避险需求，推动了债券上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids'&gt;量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Reduce US Treasury Short Bets, Fueling Bond Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:08:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] AG 布兰奇和联邦调查局帕特尔回避有关黄仁勋调查的问题</title><