e even more pain&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/c0cb932a-076e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;随着科技股涨势消退，Anthropic 跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic falls below IPO price as tech rally fades&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading'&gt;Anthropic 股价第四个交易日跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Plunge Below IPO Price in Fourth Trading Day&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/anthropic-options-trading-ipo-price.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:26:21 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>